  dialogueId: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Nero
    text: If that's the book I think it is, it holds an ancient powe a force unseen
      in this world for eons. It could give us the edge we so desperately need.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Nero
    text: 'Perhaps we should find this book ourselves? If we secure it first, we
      are the ones who set the terms. '
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
